Output "demos/x402/takes/v2-x402-take.mp4"
Set Shell bash
Set FontFamily "Menlo"
Set FontSize 31
Set Width 1920
Set Height 1080
Set Padding 8
Set Framerate 30
Hide
Type "bursar"
Enter
Wait+Screen@90s /I am ready\./
Sleep 300ms
Show
Type "what's the weather in London?"
Enter
Wait+Screen@180s /Which one/
Sleep 500ms
Type "the cheaper one"
Enter
Sleep 75s
